     "label": "A",
     "text": "4 units"
    },
    {
     "label": "B",
     "text": "8 units"
    },
    {
     "label": "C",
     "text": "16 units"
    },
    {
     "label": "D",
     "text": "32 units"
    }
   ],
   "answer": "C",
   "solution": "![4 diameters = 128 ⇒ one diameter length = 128 4 units = 32 units Radius of the circle = 32 ÷ 2 = 16 units](asset:q7-sol)",
