   "id": "q22",
   "number": "22",
   "type": "mcq_single",
   "stem": "3 identical ropes and 5 identical ribbons have a total length of 743 cm. The total length of 1 rope and 1 ribbon is 191 cm. Find the length of 1 ribbon.",
   "options": [
    {
     "label": "A",
     "text": "170 cm"
    },
    {
     "label": "B",
     "text": "80 cm"
    },
    {
     "label": "C",
     "text": "190 cm"
    },
    {
     "label": "D",
     "text": "85 cm"
    }
   ],
   "answer": "D",
   "solution": "Length of 3 ropes + 5 ribbons = 743 cm Length of 1 rope + 1 ribbon = 191 cm 3 ropes + 3 ribbons + 2 ribbons = 743 cm 3 × 191 cm + 2 ribbons = 743 cm\n\n2 ribbons = 743 – 573 = 170 cm\n\n1 ribbon = 170 ÷ 2 = 85 cm",
   "topics": [
    "Mathematics"
   ],
   "fields": {
    "Exam": "UIMO",
    "Class": 4,
    "Paper": "UIMO UM9248",
    "Paper code": "UM9248",
